  <url>
    <loc>https://www.megbrennan.com/music</loc>
    <changefreq>daily</changefreq>
    <priority>0.75</priority>
    <lastmod>2022-01-16</lastmod>
    <image:image>
      <image:loc>https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5b96917fb98a781870d1bc67/40e45e2f-3663-4c82-9f48-8c632dc900ef/LOSB_Coverart.png</image:loc>
      <image:title>Music - Legend of Sleeping Bear</image:title>
      <image:caption>Inspired by the Anishinaabe legend of the Sleeping Bear, this piece depicts a mother bear and her two cubs who were driven into Lake Michigan by a raging forest fire, showing how a tumultuous journey can leave an everlasting legacy. This composition is part of a collection of original songs available on this EP. Joshua Catania - piano Aidan Cafferty - bass David Alvarez III - drums</image:caption>
    </image:image>
    <image:image>
      <image:loc>https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5b96917fb98a781870d1bc67/21ac91f1-98b9-425e-a0ba-15bf4129488f/Justice+Come_singleart.png</image:loc>
      <image:title>Music - Justice Come (feat. Andrew Bishop)</image:title>
      <image:caption>Written the week of George Floyd’s tragic passing, this piece was composed to honor and remember his life. It explores both strength and weakness, tenderness and anger, breath and breathlessness. Andrew Bishop - tenor saxophone Joshua Catania - piano Aidan Cafferty - bass David Alvarez III - drums</image:caption>
    </image:image>
    <image:image>
      <image:loc>https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5b96917fb98a781870d1bc67/fcc8b136-77c7-464c-942d-3295d8b12187/DSC09668.jpg</image:loc>
      <image:title>Music - Standards with Friends</image:title>
      <image:caption>This EP was recorded at home during the COVID-19 global pandemic, as a way to stay connected musically and personally with some of my friends and collaborators. Brendon Davis - Piano Brandon Rose - Bass David Alvarez III - Drums</image:caption>
    </image:image>
  </url>
